<title>USA: CKE Restaurants increases semi-annual div.</title>
<headline>CKE Restaurants increases semi-annual div.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif. 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>CKE Restaurants Inc said it declared a semi-annual dividend of $0.04 per share, which is an increase over the prior dividend of $0.04 per share because of a 3-for-2 stock split on January 12.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on April 25 to shareholders of record on April 4.</p>
</text>
